WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.519 line:82% position:50% size:92%
A useful auditory-training plan specifies the skill, the

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.819 line:82% position:50% size:92%
stimuli, the activity type, and the difficulty. Formal

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.499 line:82% position:50% size:92%
work is structured, often one-to-one. Informal work occurs

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.159 line:82% position:50% size:92%
within daily routines. Both need an observable target.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.859 line:82% position:50% size:92%
You can reduce difficulty by supplying a small

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.799 line:82% position:50% size:92%
known response set, choosing more distinct sounds, improving

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.999 line:82% position:50% size:92%
the listening conditions, adding familiar context, or structuring

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.379 line:82% position:50% size:92%
the activity. Change demands deliberately and document them.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.819 line:82% position:50% size:92%
The goal is a meaningful challenge without frustration.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.319 line:82% position:50% size:92%
When writing an objective, define the child's response,

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.599 line:82% position:50% size:92%
the conditions, the success criterion, and the time

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.919 line:82% position:50% size:92%
frame. For example, specify picture identification in quiet,

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.519 line:82% position:50% size:92%
the device and distance, whether cues are allowed,

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.599 line:82% position:50% size:92%
the number of correct trials, and the deadline.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.919 line:82% position:50% size:92%
Those values come from the child's baseline and

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.539 line:82% position:50% size:92%
your plan. A cued audiovisual response does not

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.659 line:82% position:50% size:92%
demonstrate an independent auditory-only target. Keep the child's

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.259 line:82% position:50% size:92%
outcome separate from clinician responsibilities such as checking

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:51.719 line:82% position:50% size:92%
the device.
